  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prison twin, Lithuania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tvill f&#xe4;ngelse, Litauen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued assistance to the twinning cooperation between prisons. The project objective is to strengthen the capacity of the involved institutions. The project will be carried out through seminars and transfer of knowhow. The parts are the Swedish Prisons and Probation Administration and the Lithuanian Prison Department.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete mellan kriminalv&#xe5;rdsmyndigheterna i Sverige och i Litauen i syfte att st&#xe4;rka de deltagande parternas kapacitet vg personalens kompetens, s&#xe4;kerhetsrutiner, hygien, drogprogram, vuxenutbildning etc. Detta kommer att ske genom kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring och seminarieverksamhet. Svensk part &#xe4;r Kriminalv&#xe5;rdsstyrelsen.</narrative>
  </description>
